---
manual: manip.clear_with_block
lines: [2331, 2347]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @slot = stack { para "Old text" }
  @go = button("Go") { @slot.clear { para "Brand new text" } }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal ["Old text"], stack("@slot").contents.map(&:text)

button("@go").trigger_click

assert_equal ["Brand new text"], stack("@slot").contents.map(&:text), "the block's contents replaced the old ones"
